    {
      "id": "claim_021acb2251d84af38709083b624938d9",
      "statement": "The renderer only names a catalog id; URLs, file paths and the executable are decided in Rust, and every download (llama.cpp runtime from GitHub, model GGUF from Hugging Face) is SHA-256-verified against a host-published digest (GitHub asset digest / HF LFS oid), with non-matching files discarded; an install starts only after the matching plan was produced and consented to in the session.",
